  "description": "<p>Rebecca Felton was a major suffragette and the first female senator. She was also, at different points, a slave owner and professional racist who became America's #1 pro-lynching advocate.</p> <p>(2 Part Series)</p> <p>Sources:</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.senate.gov/senators/FeaturedBios/Featured_Bio_Felton.htm\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.senate.gov/senators/FeaturedBios/Featured_Bio_Felton.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1785870950622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2L6Si1N7-nmw1iZOnfgxQ-\">https://www.senate.gov/senators/FeaturedBios/Featured_Bio_Felton.htm</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/the-nations-first-woman-senator-was-a-virulent-white-supremacist-180981150/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/the-nations-first-woman-senator-was-a-virulent-white-supremacist-180981150/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1785870950622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03Ah_xehwPIfko0m8ptOHh\">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/the-nations-first-woman-senator-was-a-virulent-white-supremacist-180981150/</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://archive.is/PpZnj#selection-1919.0-1923.192\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://archive.is/PpZnj%23selection-1919.0-1923.192&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1785870950622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0g0RHBUrsNg-fwyd47POFR\">https://archive.is/PpZnj#selection-1919.0-1923.192</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://journals.openedition.org/ejas/10695\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://journals.openedition.org/ejas/10695&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1785870950622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3S9f0MPmBrcYceMe2lFa39\">https://journals.openedition.org/ejas/10695</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/1898/item/2278\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/1898/item/2278&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1785870950622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VQAVTTt3U-PHNnJl-XzWX\">https://exhibits.lib